sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor PR as Preacher
    participant SRC as MicrophoneSource
    participant VAD as SileroVAD (CPU)
    participant Q1 as audio queue
    participant ASR as FasterWhisperASR (GPU)
    participant ENR as ContextEnricher
    participant SCR as ScriptureTagger
    participant GLO as GlossaryResolver
    participant HYB as HybridTranslator
    participant FST as OpusMT (GPU)
    participant LLM as Ollama gemma3:12b (GPU)
    participant BUS as SegmentBus
    participant SUB as SubtitleSink
    participant LOG as TranscriptLogSink
    participant GW as WebSocketGateway
    participant PH as Attendee phone
    participant DB as SQLite

    PR->>SRC: speaks
    loop every 32 ms frame
        SRC->>VAD: AudioChunk
        VAD->>VAD: score frame
    end
    VAD->>VAD: silence exceeds hangover_ms (300)
    VAD->>Q1: Utterance (speech_ms >= min_speech_ms)

    alt queue full
        Q1->>Q1: drop_oldest, emit backpressure event
    end

    Q1->>ASR: dequeue Utterance
    ASR->>ASR: transcribe int8, beam_size 1
    ASR-->>ENR: Transcript (de)

    alt no_speech_prob high or empty text
        ENR->>ENR: discard segment, no publish
    else usable transcript
        ENR->>SCR: tag(text)
        SCR-->>ENR: ScriptureRef list
        ENR->>GLO: find(text)
        GLO-->>ENR: GlossaryHit list
        ENR->>ENR: attach rolling window (last 4 segments)
        ENR->>HYB: EnrichedSegment

        HYB->>HYB: needs_context()

        alt degraded mode or plain sentence
            HYB->>FST: translate
            FST-->>HYB: target text (~60 ms)
        else pronoun / scripture / glossary / mid-clause
            HYB->>LLM: prompt with window + glossary + refs
            LLM-->>HYB: target text (~650 ms)
            opt LLM timeout or CUDA error
                HYB->>FST: retry on fast path
                FST-->>HYB: target text
                HYB->>BUS: emit DEGRADE event
            end
        end

        HYB->>GLO: enforce(target, hits)
        GLO-->>HYB: corrected target
        HYB->>BUS: publish TranslationSegment

        par fan out to sinks
            BUS->>SUB: on_segment
            SUB->>GW: broadcast(lang="en", payload)
            GW-->>PH: WebSocket frame
            PH->>PH: render subtitle line
        and
            BUS->>LOG: on_segment
            LOG--)DB: async insert
        end

        BUS->>ENR: remember(segment) for next window
    end

    Note over PR,PH: fast path ~0.6 s, context path ~1.3 s from end of speech
    Note over BUS,GW: TTSSink subscribes here in phase 5, no upstream change
